ookbook:onion|Onions]] (optional), chopped\n* [[Cookbook:Salt|Salt]]\n* [[Cookbook:Pepper|Pepper]]\n* [[Cookbook:Savory|Savory]]\n* [[Cookbook:Chili Powder|Chili powder]]\n* Gyro spice\n\n==Procedure==\n# Combine the mashed potatoes, spelt flour, and oat flakes in about equal amounts (1:1:1).\n# Mix in soy sauce and water.\n# [[Cookbook:Frying|Fry]] the onions and tomatoes in a little oil, and add to the potato mixture.\n# Mix in salt, pepper, savory, chili powder, and gyro spice to taste.\n# Form the mixture into patties. Fry lightly in a pan with a thin layer of oil until browned on both sides.\n\n== Notes, tips, and variations ==\n\n* Gyro spice is a spice blend consisting of [[Cookbook:Paprika|paprika]], [[Cookbook:Chili Pepper|chili pepper]], [[Cookbook:Onion|onions]], [[Cookbook:Oregano|oregano]], [[Cookbook:Parsley|parsley]], [[Cookbook:Rosemary|rosemary]], [[Cookbook:Thyme|thyme]], [[Cookbook:Marjoram|marjoram]], [[Cookbook:Allspice|allspice]], [[Cookbook:Bay Leaf|bay leaves]], [[Cookbook:Garlic|garlic]], [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]], and/or [[Cookbook:Monosodium glutamate|monosodium glutamate]].\n\n== See also ==\n\n* [[Cookbook:Hamburger|Hamburger]]\n\n[[Category:Vegan recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using oat]]\n[[Category:Recipes using potato]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chili powder]]\n\n[[de:Kochbuch/ Kartoffel-Dinkel-Hafer-Bratling]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Potato Spelt Oat Burger","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"Mashed potatoes","sourceText":"Mashed potatoes","amountText":"Mashed potatoes","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"Spelt","sourceText":"Spelt","amountText":"Spelt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"Oat flakes","sourceText":"Oat flakes","amountText":"Oat flakes","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"Soy sauce","sourceText":"Soy sauce","amountText":"Soy sau